{"seq":47,"slug":"frontend-reactivity-signals","title":"前端细粒度响应式与信号","stage":"DONE","category":"frontend","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"前端细粒度响应式与信号\">前端细粒度响应式与信号</h1><p>2026 年的前端框架战争已经分出了一条清晰的分水岭：除 React 仍坚持「重跑组件 + 虚拟 DOM diff」的粗粒度路线外，Angular、Vue、Solid、Svelte、Preact、Qwik 几乎全部把核心建立在信号（signal）之上。信号不再是某个框架的私有发明，而是一种正在被 TC39 标准化的通用响应式原语。理解信号，就是理解这一代前端框架共享的底层心智模型。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 把「信号与细粒度响应式」拆成四条递进的主线，让你从原理一路读到工程落地，而不是停留在「某框架的某个 API 怎么用」。</p>\n<p>第一条主线是「基础」。我们先回答一个常被跳过的问题：在信号之前，前端是怎么做响应式的？从脏检查到虚拟 DOM 再到细粒度信号，每一代方案都在修补前一代的性能与心智缺陷。理清这条演进线之后，再把信号这个原语本身讲透——它本质上是一个带读追踪的可观察值，以及它如何通过运行时依赖追踪实现「不用手写订阅」的自动响应。</p>\n<p>第二条主线是「机制」。信号只是叶子节点，真正让它成为系统的，是建立在它之上的派生值（computed）与副作用（effect），以及把这些更新有序、无毛刺（glitch-free）地刷出去的调度与批处理算法。这一章解释的是「一个信号变了，到底发生了什么」。</p>\n<p>第三条主线是「框架实现」。同一套原理在不同框架里长出了不同的形态：Solid 的 getter/setter 信号、Vue 的 Proxy 响应式与基于 alien-signals 的新引擎、Angular 的 signal-first 与 zoneless、Svelte 的编译期 runes。对照着读，你会看到设计权衡的真实取舍。</p>\n<p>第四条主线是「工程实践」。信号怎么驱动真实 DOM、怎么避免内存泄漏（这是细粒度响应式最大的暗坑）、怎么和异步与全局状态共处。这一章是把前三章的原理落到生产代码上的地方。</p>\n<p>四条主线层层递进：基础给你词汇，机制给你模型，框架给你对照，实践给你边界。读完整个 hub，你应该能在任意一个基于信号的框架里准确预测「改一个值会触发什么」，并据此写出高性能、不泄漏的响应式代码。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reactivity-models-evolution","title":"响应式模型的演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/foundations/reactivity-models-evolution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"signal-core-concept","title":"信号的核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/foundations/signal-core-concept"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dependency-tracking","title":"依赖追踪与自动订阅","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/foundations/dependency-tracking"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"mechanisms","title":"机制","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/mechanisms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fine-grained-vs-vdom","title":"细粒度更新与虚拟 DOM","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/mechanisms/fine-grained-vs-vdom"},{"seq":2,"slug":"computed-and-effects","title":"计算值与副作用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/mechanisms/computed-and-effects"},{"seq":3,"slug":"scheduling-batching","title":"调度与批处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/mechanisms/scheduling-batching"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"frameworks","title":"框架实现","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/frameworks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"solidjs-signals","title":"SolidJS 信号","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/frameworks/solidjs-signals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vue-reactivity","title":"Vue 响应式系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/frameworks/vue-reactivity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"angular-svelte-signals","title":"Angular Signals 与 Svelte Runes","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/frameworks/angular-svelte-signals"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"signals-and-rendering","title":"信号与渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/practice/signals-and-rendering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-and-cleanup","title":"内存与清理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/practice/memory-and-cleanup"},{"seq":3,"slug":"async-and-state","title":"异步与状态管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-reactivity-signals/practice/async-and-state"}]}]}